silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'OlogNodeArrowLawConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, TartuClinicIntakeForm: the DICOM/HL7 intake form submitted for Mittens's May 2026 annual exam at the Tartu Animal Clinic; the raw source packet before any gate; also, VetRecord_77: the ingested encyclopedia entry for Mittens's 2026-05-18 vet visit; output of the ingest gate; also, MittensSpeciesNode: VetRecord_77 with the species type DomesticCat / Felis catus / TSN 183798 assigned; output of the type gate." .
